chuan Charlie Tang","Ruslan Salakhutdinov"],"abstract":"Temporal prediction is critical for making intelligent and robust decisions in complex dynamic environments. Motion prediction needs to model the inherently uncertain future which often contains multiple potential outcomes, due to multi-agent interactions and the latent goals of others. Towards these goals, we introduce a probabilistic framework that efficiently learns latent variables to jointly model the multi-step future motions of agents in a...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/multiple-futures-prediction","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["agent"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"official:397b9b2f2caeed55","title":"Deep double descent","url":"https://openai.com/index/deep-double-descent","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://openai.com/index/deep-double-descent"],"alternate_titles":["Deep double descent"],"published":"2019-12-05","authors":["OpenAI"],"abstract":"We show that the double descent phenomenon occurs in CNNs, ResNets, and transformers: performance first improves, then gets worse, and then